{
  "_id": "CNzUcoakHX0WMxo5",
  "name": "Metal Attunement",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Metal_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You harden your body to be like steel, making you especially resilient to damage.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Armor</strong> and <strong>Defense</strong> increase by 1.</p><p>Additionally, you are immune to being <strong>Contaminated</strong>, and cannot be damaged by <strong>Hazards</strong>. Your <strong>Unarmed</strong> attacks are no longer considered <strong>Ineffective</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success increases the duration by 1.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase your <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success, or your <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p>",
